# ----------------------------
# Generated agent rules
# ----------------------------
# `next dev` (Next.js 16.3+) writes these into the Next.js starter. Scoped to
# this repo's copy: the template's own .gitignore ships to every scaffold, where
# a project may well want to commit its own.
templates/fullstack/nextjs/AGENTS.md
templates/fullstack/nextjs/CLAUDE.md
